| `Duration`      | Localize   | —         | `Enum.sort`  | —                   | Localize      |
| `Date.Range`    | Localize   | Calendrical | `Enum.sort`  | `<.date_range_input>` | Localize      |
| `Range`         | Localize   | —         | `Enum.sort`  | —                   | Localize      |
| `List`          | Localize   | —         | `Enum.sort`  | —                   | Ecto          |

